## Model card

- **Name:** GLM-5.3-FlashX
- **Short description:** High-throughput serving variant of Z.ai's multimodal GLM-5.3-Flash, advertised at about 200 tokens/s.
- **Provider / access:** Z.ai/OpenAI-compatible chat API; third-party route ID `tencent/glm-5.3-flashx`.
- **Release / knowledge:** Added September 2026; knowledge cutoff not published.
- **IDs:** `glm-5.3-flashx`, `zai/glm-5.3-flashx`; no verified Zen Free ID.
- **Context window:** Provider catalogs report 1,048,576 tokens and up to 131,072 output tokens.
- **Modalities:** Text, image, video, and file input; text output; reasoning, tools, caching, and JSON schema advertised.
- **Pricing (as of 2026-10-07):** $0.37/M input, $1.25/M output, about $0.075/M cached input ([current catalog](https://www.requesty.ai/models/tencent/glm-5.3-flashx)).
- **Architecture:** Reported as the GLM-5.3 hybrid sparse/linear-attention family; exact FlashX weights are not independently documented.

